        "original_id": "ed596b4a-9e16-5aaa-9a0d-558420c59b31",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Little Women (1933 film)\n- People: George Cukor, Katharine Hepburn, Joan Bennett, Frances Dee, Jean Parker, Charles F. Miller, Robert Lowery Hanks\n- Topics: Film debuts, marriages, children\n\nFacts:\n- Little Women is a 1933 American pre-Code drama film.\n- George Cukor directed Little Women.\n- Katharine Hepburn, Joan Bennett, Frances Dee, and Jean Parker starred in Little Women.\n- Charles F. Miller made his film debut in Little Women as a minister.\n- Charles F. Miller appeared in many films after his debut in Little Women.\n- Jean Parker was married four times.\n- Jean Parker had one son named Robert Lowery Hanks.",
